title: "Book Hunter (书猎)"
abstract: "A local-first, MIT-licensed multi-format ebook library and reader for Windows. EPUB, MOBI, AZW3, PDF and TXT are normalised to EPUB with a home-grown typesetting engine, full-text search and inline bilingual translation."
